(7668599, 1251297, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  So far from what I expected, which makes the journey all the more rewarding.</td>', 'Very nice.  So far from what I expected, which makes the journey all the more rewarding.', '2020-07-03 11:22:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7668600, 1251302, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait.  Straightforward and keen.  I sense controlled exuberance and determination.  The head-on set of the eyeglasses is perfect.  The tone is subtle and sumptuous.  Calls for marble and a Michaelangelo.</td>', 'Terrific portrait.  Straightforward and keen.  I sense controlled exuberance and determination.  The head-on set of the eyeglasses is perfect.  The tone is subtle and sumptuous.  Calls for marble and a Michaelangelo.', '2020-07-03 11:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7668601, 1251281, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine group portrait.  So current and harmoniously variant.  The clever, atmospheric overlay bespeaks virus and trouble in the air, yet there''s a steadfast confidence in their miens.  I''m most curious about what the young lad in the front is holding in his hand.  A treasured amulet?</td>', 'Fine group portrait.  So current and harmoniously variant.  The clever, atmospheric overlay bespeaks virus and trouble in the air, yet there''s a steadfast confidence in their miens.  I''m most curious about what the young lad in the front is holding in his hand.  A treasured amulet?', '2020-07-03 11:37:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7668602, 1250954, 173844, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrayal of our times.  Deep points are made, like notes on a somber xylophone, echoed by the tight verticals of the fence.  We''re held away from so much.  We''re limping.  Her placement, walking out of the picture, resonates.  And it''s in black and white, drained of color.  Nice composition.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A wonderful portrayal of our times.  Deep points are made, like notes on a somber xylophone, echoed by the tight verticals of the fence.  We''re held away from so much.  We''re limping.  Her placement, walking out of the picture, resonates.  And it''s in black and white, drained of color.  Nice composition.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-07-03 12:08:07.000000', NULL, 0),
