(7669074, 1251281, 35560, '<td valign="top">This is such an interesting picture!  Really got my mind spinning. Im assuming this is a christening?  Is this real, or (brilliantly staged?j So why is the Jewish menorah behind them? Is it a shared facility?  If its a religious building how come the young girl has bare shoulders?.  I can imagine mom rummaging through her fabric bin, trying to find suitable material for everyones mask. Mom telling Dad to wear a suit, but he wore his Best Denim Jacket.  And even under her mask, Mom is beaming.  And that beautiful baby girl!  Shes exquisite.  Great photo.</td>', 'This is such an interesting picture!  Really got my mind spinning. Im assuming this is a christening?  Is this real, or (brilliantly staged?j So why is the Jewish menorah behind them? Is it a shared facility?  If its a religious building how come the young girl has bare shoulders?.  I can imagine mom rummaging through her fabric bin, trying to find suitable material for everyones mask. Mom telling Dad to wear a suit, but he wore his Best Denim Jacket.  And even under her mask, Mom is beaming.  And that beautiful baby girl!  Shes exquisite.  Great photo.', '2020-07-08 06:02:28.000000', NULL, 0);
